    "catalogue_description": "Quick synopsis of the map: You and your buds have been pushed back to the fort after a big battle that took place; now you must defend the fort against wave after wave of nazi and Japanese zombies. Tons of great sniping on this map. My buds and I had a blast with this map; lots of zombies to snipe. Known Bug: Zombies sometimes get stuck outside the main wall; no worries on this, they die off on their own after about 20 seconds. This is my first COD Zombie map; so some things could have been done better. Spent a lot of my time on testing/tweaking.",
